{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a cooperative first-person adventure for 2 players where you and your friend must navigate through a series of tests specially designed to teach you the basics of voluntary and effective servitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will play as Bot &amp; Tic, devoted servants of the interplanetary renowned company Botopia, a great pioneer in the field of assistance automatons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your certification by completing various logic challenges under the sharp supervision of an instructor with questionable values, all set in a retro-futuristic cartoon-style universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your piloting skills to the test on the latest generation ships, learn to navigate the vastness of the galaxy, or perfect your musical talents, and you may just become worthy of receiving the highly coveted certification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn, adapt, and communicate to prove your worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join TwinTies in their first adventure with Bot &amp; Tic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511810/extras/propagande.png?t=1742484210\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511810?t=1742484210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742484210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511810/e4990e2254a52a2f78d098782b37f7904558eeca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742484210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511810/e4990e2254a52a2f78d098782b37f7904558eeca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742484210","categor